cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Human Gut Cell Atlas v1 downstream analyses"
message: If you use this software, please cite the HGCA v1 paper and this repository.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/HCA-integration/hca-gut-atlas-downstream
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - gut
  - cell atlas
  - composition
abstract: >
  Analysis and figure-generation code for The Human Gut Cell Atlas v1.0.
  A small bundled subset is included to check that representative
  scripts execute; those results are not manuscript values.
